  "scope": "Bounded TRAIN-only 12-attempt mixed-scene retention pilot from projected600. Eighteen disjoint scene identities: six update, six anchor, six monitor, each three motion strata and three replay. Salted-hash selection independent of DEV scores; replay crop fixed before optimization. Two arms share initial weights/order/scales and projected current-batch direction. Current-only accepts current photo/detail and temporal nonincrease with strict motion temporal or replay photo improvement. Anchor arm additionally requires EACH panel member photo/detail/temporal/log-detail no worse than both previous accepted panel and initial panel within tolerance, with no lost valid log edges. Anchor gradients do not alter proposal. Monitor never used for acceptance. Record initial/final region metrics and evaluations/cost. Rejection restores parameters and optimizer exactly; always advance to next batch. No saved inference weights, DEV tuning, release or generalization claim. Follow-up compares an additional panel-aware direction: project raw Adam displacement onto all current and anchor photo/detail/temporal/log-detail gradient halfspaces using nonnegative least squares dual; validate feasibility and complementarity. Same18 scenes,12 attempts, four scales and exact finite-step gates. Anchor gradients are evaluated at pre-step weights; proposed optimizer moments remain unchanged on accepted scaled steps. Record rejecting panel members/objectives. No source/checkpoint promotion. Existing controls rerun to verify reproduction.",
  "methods": [
    "current_only",
    "anchor_guard",
    "anchor_direction"
  ],
